title: Arrival
tags: chapter_1 emberfall_gate
---
<<declare $mara_trust = 0>>
<<declare $has_watch_map = false>>
<<declare $watch_alerted = false>>
Narrator: Rain turns the road to Emberfall into black glass. #line:arrival_rain
Mara: The western gate closes at midnight. Decide whether you are coming with me. #line:arrival_mara_offer
-> Help Mara hide the courier satchel #line:arrival_help
    Player: I will carry it through the market. #line:arrival_help_reply
    <<set $mara_trust to $mara_trust + 1>>
    <<set $has_watch_map to true>>
    <<jump Market>>
-> Refuse and approach the watch alone #line:arrival_refuse
    Player: I want no part in a smuggler's bargain. #line:arrival_refuse_reply
    <<set $mara_trust to $mara_trust - 1>>
    <<jump Watchtower>>
===
